{"text": "Later a man appeared on the beach and began waving his coat, and soon a hotel bus full of people stopped to watch the boat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The men hoped for a rescue, but the people on shore only waved, as if they thought the boat was out fishing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Darkness came on at last, the man and the bus disappearing, and the four men were alone again with the cold sea. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Through the long night the oiler and the correspondent rowed in turns, while the cook talked about pies until he fell asleep. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The water was so cold that the sleeping men in the bottom of the boat lay shivering, their legs tangled together. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Once, while the others slept, a great fin cut through the dark water near the boat, leaving a trail of blue light. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The correspondent felt as if he were the only man on all the oceans, and he wished that a friend would wake up. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he remembered a poem from his school days about a soldier of the Legion, who lay dying in Algiers, far from his home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As a boy he had never cared about that soldier, but now, cold and alone at sea, he felt the mans sorrow as his own.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "a", "t", "e", "r", " ", "a", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "a", "p", "p", "e", "a", "r", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "a", "c", "h", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "b", "e", "g", "a", "n", " ", "w", "a", "v", "i", "n", "g", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "c", "o", "a", "t", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "o", "o", "n", " ", "a", " ", "h", "o", "t", "e", "l", " ", "b", "u", "s", " ", "f", "u", "l", "l", " ", "o", "f", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "s", "t", "o", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "w", "a", "t", "c", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "a", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " "